    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your life takes an unexpected turn when, after (accidentally) agreeing to the terms of a mysterious contract, you end up living with Mika Nyanami \u2014 a mischievous alien catgirl sent by the Multispecies Preservation Alliance to carry out a... reproductive mission.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, you'll have to spend <strong>several days with her</strong> under evaluation, completing strange objectives like maintaining her levels of socialization, nutrition, hygiene, entertainment... and intimacy.<br>If you fail, the Alliance may deem your planet unfit for preservation...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And as if that weren\u2019t enough, you'll also have to deal with a government agent who suspects you\u2019re hiding an alien entity at home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753520/extras/1af7992e977c4a4aea61fd92553b122e.avif?t=1755096590\" width=800 height=333 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude3a An adorable and cheeky alien guest you'll be living with.<br>\ud83e\uddfc Choose where to work, come back home, interact with Mika, clean, cook, or play.<br>\ud83e\uddea Mysterious goals imposed by an alien AI.<br>\ud83c\udfae Unlockable scenes, from everyday moments to suggestive situations.<br>\ud83d\udd25 NSFW content included.<br>\ud83d\udef8 A story that blends comedy, eroticism, and sci-fi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Objective</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep Mika\u2019s emotional and physical levels stable to pass the evaluation.<br>If you succeed, she might get to stay with you forever...<br>But if you fail, the Alliance has its own methods to shut down the project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings available.</p>",
